      "content": "It is a terrible burden to carry the weight of everyone else's expectations while feeling completely invisible to yourself. You are right that the cycle of exhaustion and numbness feels endless, but your pain is real and it matters. Sometimes the only way to break free from this cage is to stop trying to fix it and start letting go of the need to be something you are not.",
